Delete this file to stop the multiplayer diagnostics line.

While it is present, one line a minute is written to your Cosmoteer log
(Saved Games\Cosmoteer\<id>\Logs\log <date>.txt) recording memory, GC counts,
simulation size and each player's lockstep input queue. It is read-only: it
never touches a queue, a resource or the simulation.

Both peers need this file. A stall can only be attributed to one side by
comparing the same minute in both logs.
